From 04d3f1fb54f2aabb9c615ba56266ff4345a75c73 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 17 Sep 2026 11:16:22 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Restyle Apply screen hero to match approved peppy mockup, fix
 back-button overlap

The back arrow was overlapping the Fanman mascot's cape in the previous
hero layout (Sumaksh's screenshot feedback: "fanman may back button hai").
Moved it to its own circular button anchored to the hero's top-left
corner so it's independent of the mascot/cape group's flex layout.

Also brought the screen closer to the Round 6 "Apna Dealer Code" Artifact
mockup that was approved but never carried into the real page: added the
Fredoka display font (used only for headings, matching the mockup's font
pairing), a brand-tag pill, a bigger bouncing Fanman with a "Hi!" speech
bubble and twinkling sparkles, and a lavender-to-pink gradient page
background. Section headers (Shop Registration Type / Identity Documents
/ Photos / Videos) now use the same Fredoka heading style with an emoji
icon, echoing the mockup's card-header treatment.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01GxWPdEf21EL6SvRpGBbX8q
